+msgstr "每个视图在近处物体后面看到、而画面中没有的区域如何填充。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
+msgid "Fill neighbourhood (pixels)"
+msgstr "填充邻域（像素）"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
