+msgstr "3D 影片：背景上的畫面和深度圖"
+
+msgctxt "@action"
+msgid "3D Video: Draw the Views from Depth Maps"
+msgstr "3D 影片：由深度圖繪製視圖"
+
+msgctxt "@action"
+msgid "3D Video Settings…"
+msgstr "3D 影片設定…"
+
+msgctxt "@action"
+msgid "Display Settings…"
+msgstr "顯示設定…"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: automatic"
+msgstr "3D 影片：自動"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: not 3D"
+msgstr "3D 影片：非 3D"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: side by side, half width views"
+msgstr "3D 影片：左右並排，半寬視圖"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: side by side, full width views"
+msgstr "3D 影片：左右並排，全寬視圖"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: top and bottom, half height views"
+msgstr "3D 影片：上下排列，半高視圖"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: top and bottom, full height views"
+msgstr "3D 影片：上下排列，全高視圖"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "Swap eyes: %1"
+msgstr "交換左右眼：%1"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: on"
+msgstr "3D 影片：開"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: off"
+msgstr "3D 影片：關"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: picture and depth map, side by side"
+msgstr "3D 影片：畫面和深度圖，左右並排"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: depth map and picture, side by side"
+msgstr "3D 影片：深度圖和畫面，左右並排"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: picture above its depth map"
+msgstr "3D 影片：畫面在上，深度圖在下"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: depth map above its picture"
+msgstr "3D 影片：深度圖在上，畫面在下"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: picture, depth map and graphics"
+msgstr "3D 影片：畫面、深度圖和圖形"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "3D video: picture and depth map over a background"
+msgstr "3D 影片：背景上的畫面和深度圖"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "Views from depth maps: on"
+msgstr "由深度圖產生視圖：開"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "Views from depth maps: off"
+msgstr "由深度圖產生視圖：關"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "The eye swap could not be kept with this file"
+msgstr "無法將左右眼交換儲存到此檔案"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "The eye swap is kept with this file"
+msgstr "左右眼交換已儲存到此檔案"
+
+msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
+msgid "3D Video"
+msgstr "3D 影片"
+
+msgctxt "@title:menu"
+msgid "3D Video"
+msgstr "3D 影片"
+
+msgctxt "@action"
+msgid "3D Video"
+msgstr "3D 影片"
+
+msgctxt "@title"
+msgid "3D video"
+msgstr "3D 影片"
+
+msgctxt "@option:check"
+msgid "Enable 3D"
+msgstr "啟用 3D"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "Shows 3D videos in 3D, whatever their packing, as full side by side views for the screen's 3D mode. When off, a 3D video is shown as it is stored."
+msgstr "無論 3D 影片如何排列，都以全尺寸左右並排視圖依螢幕的 3D 模式顯示為 3D。關閉時，3D 影片依其儲存的樣子顯示。"
+
+msgctxt "@label"
+msgid "Screen"
+msgstr "螢幕"
+
+msgctxt "@action:button"
+msgid "Display Settings…"
+msgstr "顯示設定…"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "The screen's 3D mode is chosen in KDE's display settings."
+msgstr "螢幕的 3D 模式在 KDE 的顯示設定中選擇。"
+
+msgctxt "@title"
+msgid "Videos with a depth map"
+msgstr "帶深度圖的影片"
+
+msgctxt "@option:check"
+msgid "Draw the two views from the depth map"
+msgstr "由深度圖繪製兩個視圖"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "A video that comes with its depth map (2D plus depth: packed in the frame, a depth layer of H.265, or a depth stream of its own) is shown in 3D. When off, its picture is shown alone. The depth layer of an H.265 video is decoded in software."
+msgstr "帶深度圖的影片（2D 加深度：打包在影格中、H.265 的深度層，或獨立的深度串流）以 3D 顯示。關閉時只顯示畫面。H.265 影片的深度層以軟體解碼。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:listbox"
+msgid "The picture is"
+msgstr "畫面位於"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox the picture is"
+msgid "The left eye's view"
+msgstr "左眼視圖"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox the picture is"
+msgid "Between the eyes"
+msgstr "兩眼之間"
+
+msgctxt "@label:listbox"
+msgid "Warping"
+msgstr "變形"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox warping"
+msgid "Forward"
+msgstr "正向"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox warping"
+msgid "Backward"
+msgstr "反向"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox warping"
+msgid "Layered"
+msgstr "分層"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "Forward moves each pixel of the picture to its place in the view; backward moves the depth first, then takes each pixel of the view from the picture; layered draws the edges of near objects as a layer over the rest."
+msgstr "正向將畫面的每個像素移到視圖中的位置；反向先移動深度，再從畫面中取視圖的每個像素；分層將近處物體的邊緣作為一層繪製在其餘部分之上。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:listbox"
+msgid "Uncovered areas"
+msgstr "露出區域"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox fill"
+msgid "Extend the background"
+msgstr "延伸背景"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox fill"
+msgid "From background pixels"
+msgstr "取自背景像素"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox fill"
+msgid "Inpaint (Telea)"
+msgstr "修補（Telea）"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox fill"
+msgid "Leave black"
+msgstr "保留黑色"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "How the areas each view sees behind near objects, which the picture does not show, are filled."
+msgstr "每個視圖在近處物體後面看到、而畫面中沒有的區域如何填補。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
+msgid "Fill neighbourhood (pixels)"
+msgstr "填補鄰域（像素）"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "The neighbourhood that the background pixels and inpainting fills take the colours from."
+msgstr "取自背景像素的填補和修補所取顏色的鄰域。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:listbox"
+msgid "Depth smoothing"
+msgstr "深度平滑"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox smoothing"
+msgid "Off"
+msgstr "關"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox smoothing"
+msgid "Asymmetric Gaussian"
+msgstr "非對稱高斯"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "Smoothing the depth map before drawing leaves fewer and smaller uncovered areas, and bends straight lines near the edges of objects."
+msgstr "繪製前平滑深度圖會使露出區域更少、更小，但會使物體邊緣附近的直線彎曲。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
+msgid "Horizontal smoothing (pixels at 1920)"
+msgstr "水平平滑（以 1920 寬計的像素）"
+
+msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
+msgid "Vertical smoothing (pixels at 1920)"
+msgstr "垂直平滑（以 1920 寬計的像素）"
+
+msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
+msgid "Depth range (pixels at 1920)"
+msgstr "深度範圍（以 1920 寬計的像素）"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "For depth maps without distances: the largest shift between the eyes either side of the screen, in pixels of a picture 1920 wide. 58, the default, is about one degree for a viewer three picture heights away."
+msgstr "對於沒有距離的深度圖：螢幕前後兩側兩眼之間的最大偏移，以 1920 寬畫面的像素計。預設值 58 對於距離三個畫面高度的觀看者約為一度。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
+msgid "Screen position"
+msgstr "螢幕位置"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "For depth maps without distances: where the screen is, from the farthest depth (0) to the nearest (1). Things nearer than it come out of the screen."
+msgstr "對於沒有距離的深度圖：螢幕所在的位置，從最遠的深度（0）到最近的深度（1）。比它近的物體會出屏。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
+msgid "Shift (pixels at 1920)"
+msgstr "偏移（以 1920 寬計的像素）"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "A shift between the eyes added everywhere: positive moves the whole scene behind the screen, negative in front of it."
+msgstr "處處加上的兩眼之間的偏移：正值將整個場景移到螢幕後面，負值移到螢幕前面。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:listbox"
+msgid "Depth samples mean"
+msgstr "深度樣本含義"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "What the video says"
+msgstr "依影片所述"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "Nearer when larger"
+msgstr "越大越近"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "Farther when larger"
+msgstr "越大越遠"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "Inverse distance (1/Z)"
+msgstr "距離倒數（1/Z）"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "Disparity"
+msgstr "視差"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "Distance (Z)"
+msgstr "距離（Z）"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "Non-linear disparity"
+msgstr "非線性視差"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "Parallax map"
+msgstr "螢幕視差圖"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "Distance, near to far (Dynamic Depth)"
+msgstr "距離，由近到遠（Dynamic Depth）"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "Inverse distance, near to far (Dynamic Depth)"
+msgstr "距離倒數，由近到遠（Dynamic Depth）"
+
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox depth meaning"
+msgid "A depth sensor's distances"
+msgstr "深度感測器的距離"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "What a sample of the depth map means, in place of what the video says about it."
+msgstr "深度圖樣本的含義，取代影片對它的說明。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
+msgid "Near distance"
+msgstr "近距離"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "With the far distance: the distances of a Z or Dynamic Depth map that carries none, or between which a sensor's distances are spread, in the map's own unit. 0 leaves them to the video."
+msgstr "與遠距離一起：不帶距離的 Z 或 Dynamic Depth 深度圖的距離，或感測器距離分布的範圍，使用深度圖自身的單位。0 表示交由影片決定。"
+
+msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
+msgid "Far distance"
+msgstr "遠距離"
+
+msgctxt "@label:textbox"
+msgid "Depth mark"
+msgstr "深度標記"
+
+msgctxt "@info:placeholder"
+msgid "for example: inverseZ near=0.25 far=10"
+msgstr "例如：inverseZ near=0.25 far=10"
+
+msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
+msgid "What a depth sample means, with all its values, as a Stereo3DDepth mark of Sparky Stereo OS: a kind, then key=value pairs. It comes before the choice above and what the video says; a malformed mark shows the picture alone."
+msgstr "以 Sparky Stereo OS 的 Stereo3DDepth 標記給出深度樣本的含義及其全部數值：先是種類，然後是 鍵=值 對。它優先於上面的選擇和影片的說明；格式錯誤的標記只顯示畫面。"
+
+msgctxt "@info"
+msgid "Changes apply at once to a picture packed with its depth map and to a depth layer, and from the next video to a depth stream of its own."
+msgstr "變更會立即套用於與深度圖打包在一起的畫面和深度層，對於獨立的深度串流則從下一部影片開始套用。"
